  "rationale": "Comprehensive dataset reconnaissance to establish trust in identifiers and relationships. Includes schema profiling for data contract, all-column missingness analysis for complete data quality visibility, candidate key validation across all dimensions, date range analysis with consistency checks (critical for adjudication sequence and temporal integrity), join validation across all relationships (essential to identify pharmacy NPI linkage gaps evident in manifest), and structured report with denominators and artifact citations for reproducibility and statistical discipline."
